<title>UK: BT holders to vote on MCI pact on April 15.</title>
<headline>BT holders to vote on MCI pact on April 15.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc said on Friday it would hold a meeting on April 15 for shareholders to approve its planned $20 billion merger with U.S. group MCI Communications Corp.</p>
<p>The extraordinary general meeting will be held at Wembley Conference Centre in London.</p>
<p>BT said it would send the listing particulars and circular relating to the deal to shareholders as of March 17.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
